[00:34.78] Guinnevere had green eyes
[00:39.76] Like yours, m'lady, like yours
[00:49.69] She'd walk down
[00:55.07] Through the garden
[00:56.85] In the morning after it rained
[01:02.18] Peacocks wandered aimlessly
[01:11.44] Underneath an orange tree
[01:19.22] Why can't she see me?
[01:37.72] Guinnevere drew pentagrams
[01:44.28] Like yours, m'lady, like yours
[01:52.17] Late at night
[01:58.24] When she thought
[01:59.76] That no one was watching at all
[02:07.25] On the wall
[02:11.44] She shall be free
[02:38.20] As she turns her gaze
[02:44.66] Down the slope
[02:48.11] To the harbor where I lay
[02:54.97] Anchored for a day
[03:02.53] Guinnevere had golden hair
[03:11.58] Like yours, m'lady, like yours
[03:18.81] Streaming out
[03:24.24] When we'd ride
[03:25.82] Through the warm wind down by the bay
[03:32.11] Yesterday
[03:37.76] Seagulls circle endlessly
[03:42.06] I sing in silent harmony
[03:48.55] We shall be free
[03:59.91] 